ing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekang1997/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekang1997/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekang1997/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekang1997/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekang1997/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekang1997/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekang1997/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-22T04:05:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-22T04:05:46Z","body":"i found the solution. Even the office 0.16.4 version of deepspeed is still has the problem.\nThe key is json config wrong! When stage=3!! you MUST!!!! have to add the list content  \"\"optimizer\": {\n    \"type\": \"AdamW\",\n    \"params\": {\n        \"lr\": 0.001,\n        \"betas\": [0.9, 0.999],\n        \"eps\": 1e-8,\n        \"weight_decay\": 0.01\n    }\n},\n\"scheduler\": {\n    \"type\": \"WarmupLR\",\n    \"params\": {\n        \"warmup_min_lr\": 0.0001,\n        \"warmup_max_lr\": 0.001,\n        \"warmup_num_steps\": 200\n    }\n},\"  \n**olny this way  can solve the problem you can use** :\"\n\n**model_engine.zero_grad()\nmodel_engine.backward(loss)\n model_engine.step()  \"**    \n\n\nmy full json config is there :\"{\n  \"train_batch_size\": 8,\n  \"train_micro_batch_size_per_gpu\": 2,\n  \"gradient_accumulation_steps\": 4,\n  \"zero_allow_untested_optimizer\": true,\n\n  \"fp16\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"loss_scale\": 0\n  },\n\"optimizer\": {\n    \"type\": \"AdamW\",\n    \"params\": {\n        \"lr\": 0.001,\n        \"betas\": [0.9, 0.999],\n        \"eps\": 1e-8,\n        \"weight_decay\": 0.01\n    }\n},\n\"scheduler\": {\n    \"type\": \"WarmupLR\",\n    \"params\": {\n        \"warmup_min_lr\": 0.0001,\n        \"warmup_max_lr\": 0.001,\n        \"warmup_num_steps\": 200\n    }\n},\n\n  \"zero_optimization\": {\n    \"stage\": 3,\n    \"contiguous_gradients\": true,\n    \"reduce_scatter\": true,\n    \"reduce_bucket_size\": 5e8,\n    \"stage3_prefetch_bucket_size\": 5e8,\n    \"stage3_param_persistence_threshold\": 1e6,\n    \"stage3_gather_fp16_weights_on_model_save\": true,\n    \n    \"offload_param\": { \n      \"device\": \"cpu\", \n      \"pin_memory\": true \n    },\n    \"offload_optimizer\": { \n      \"device\": \"cpu\", \n      \"pin_memory\": true \n    }\n  },\n\n\n  \"pipeline\": {\n    \"enabled\": false,\n    \"mp_degree\": 1,\n    \"dp_degree\": 1,\n    \"pp_degree\": 1\n  }\n}\" and then  i can continue solve the next question \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/984bfcce-a9c7-429f-b7bc-88bb5981d8ad) ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/issues/comments/2744967630/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/issues/comments/2745306947","html_url":"https://github.com/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/issues/3024#issuecomment-2745306947","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/issues/3024","id":2745306947,"node_id":"IC_kwDODg7w7M6jog9D","user":{"login":"tjruwase","id":4271600,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNzE2MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4271600?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tjruwase","html_url":"https://github.com/tjruwase","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tjruwase/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tjruwase/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tjruwase/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tjruwase/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tjruwase/subscriptions","organizations_u